      "statement": "DeepAgentRuntime executes shell/filesystem work through a non-virtual LocalShellBackend rooted at DEEPAGENTS_TALON_WORKSPACE (or the current directory) with a scrubbed child environment that drops secrets and env-hijack keys and replaces PATH with a fixed safe path.",
