      "id": "claim_a48bf7db8fb14e018b384f143fbe78b7",
      "statement": "PersistentCronScheduler is a minute-granularity ticker that scans immediately, wakes on its tick interval or stop signal, runs due jobs, and logs a failed scan before retrying on the normal interval.",
